## ScopeGate

Make the repair boundary explicit.

ScopeGate is a focused iPhone and iPad app built around a clear, repeatable primary journey.

COMPLETE THE CORE JOURNEY

• Create and save a boundary
• Resolve a proposed change
• Recover and carry data

STAY IN CONTROL

• Free uninterrupted core
• Adapt and assist
• Switch language without mutation

DESIGNED FOR EVERYDAY USE

• Source idea ID: APP-240; English name: Scope Gate; Chinese name: 维修授权闸门; category 19, 搬家、离职、就医与紧急节点
• Target users: people sending electronics, bicycles, appliances, or cars for repair who worry that the scope will expand
• Trigger: a repair person proposes a part replacement, extra labor, or another treatment and the customer needs to confirm authorization quickly

The essential ScopeGate experience remains available without advertising or an account.

